    "body": "## Linked Issue\n\nCloses #81\n\n## Description\n\nThis PR adds the answer to the \"What type of support will there be?\" FAQ on the homepage. The answer says that everyone who takes part in OSWeave will be invited to join the Virtual Coffee Slack. It lists the `#help-and-pairing`, `#open-source`, and `#co-working-room` channels. It also says that Virtual Coffee and HCLB Communities will run events during OSWeave.\n\nThis PR also moves the \"What type of support will there be?\" FAQ under \"Does it cost anything to participate in OSWeave?\", and puts \"How many roles can I take on?\" in its previous place.\n\n## Methodology\n\n## Code of Conduct\n\n> By submitting this pull request, you agree to follow our [Code of Conduct](https://virtualcoffee.io/code-of-conduct/)"
  },
